    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Kobold Fenari fight as one pack. When you hit a creature with an attack, one ally who can see that creature can take a Reaction to move up to 5 feet without provoking Opportunity Attacks and make one attack against it. You can use this trait a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
